<title>USA: Ultratech Stepper adopts poison pill.</title>
<headline>Ultratech Stepper adopts poison pill.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ultratech Stepper Inc said it adopted a shareholder rights plan -- commonly known as a poison pill -- to guard against a hostile takeover of the company.</p>
<p>The company will distribute the rights to shareholders as a dividend at the rate of one preferred share purchase right on each outstanding share of common stock held by February 24. The Rights expire on February 9, 2007, the company said.</p>
<p>The company makes and markets photolithography steppers used in the making of semiconductors.</p>
